%% M2 key flow 1: anonymous fee estimate (POST /api/v1/pricing/quotes).
%% Public path - no bearer token. Integration pattern: synchronous request/reply.
%% Simplified for the design report: the happy path only. Validation and the
%% DISTRICT_NOT_SERVICED / SIZE_CLASS_WEIGHT_EXCEEDED guards are described in the text.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor G as Guest (browser)
    participant W as Web app<br/>(Next.js BFF)
    participant GW as api-gateway
    participant PS as pricing-service
    participant RD as Redis

    G->>W: enter districts, weight,<br/>size class, service level
    W->>GW: POST /api/v1/pricing/quotes
    GW->>PS: forward (public path,<br/>no token required)
    PS->>PS: resolve zones, select the rate card<br/>in force, calculate the fee
    PS->>RD: save quote snapshot<br/>(TTL 15 minutes)
    RD-->>PS: ok
    Note over PS,RD: saved before the reply is sent, so every<br/>quote shown can be looked up later
    PS-->>GW: 201: fee, breakdown,<br/>zones, quoteId, expiresAt
    GW-->>W: 201 quote
    W-->>G: itemised fee and<br/>expiry countdown
